 "lines": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "In 1947… a moth made a computer fail.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 3.393
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "speaker": "leo",
   "text": "Wait. A moth? Like… you?",
   "start": 3.593,
   "end": 5.086
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "Like me.",
   "start": 5.336,
   "end": 6.168
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "Picture Harvard, 1947. The Mark II.",
   "start": 6.518,
   "end": 9.398
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "A room full of relays: little metal switches that click open, and shut, to do math.",
   "start": 9.698,
   "end": 14.349
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "On September 9th, it started making errors.",
   "start": 14.699,
   "end": 17.109
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "So the team went looking for the problem…",
   "start": 17.409,
   "end": 19.457
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "and found her.",
   "start": 20.057,
   "end": 21.017
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "A moth. Stuck between the contacts.",
   "start": 21.467,
   "end": 23.387
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "speaker": "leo",
   "text": "No way!",
   "start": 23.507,
   "end": 24.318
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "So they did the most engineer thing ever.",
   "start": 24.568,
   "end": 26.595
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "They taped her into the logbook, and wrote:",
   "start": 26.795,
   "end": 28.757
  },
  {
   "scene": 9,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "\"First actual case of bug being found.\"",
   "start": 29.307,
   "end": 31.697
  },
  {
   "scene": 10,
   "speaker": "leo",
   "text": "So that's where \"bug\" comes from!",
   "start": 32.047,
   "end": 33.753
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "Nope.",
   "start": 33.873,
   "end": 34.449
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "Engineers already called glitches bugs. Edison wrote it in 1878.",
   "start": 34.799,
   "end": 39.493
  },
  {
   "scene": 12,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "That's the joke. An actual bug.",
   "start": 39.843,
   "end": 41.677
  },
  {
   "scene": 13,
   "speaker": "leo",
   "text": "Okay, but Grace Hopper found it, right?",
   "start": 41.977,
   "end": 44.111
  },
  {
   "scene": 14,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "Bright light.",
   "start": 44.261,
   "end": 45.071
  },
  {
   "scene": 14,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "Lamp or fire?",
   "start": 45.271,
   "end": 46.253
  },
  {
   "scene": 14,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "She was on the team, and she helped make the story famous.",
   "start": 46.603,
   "end": 49.397
  },
  {
   "scene": 15,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "That page is still kept at the Smithsonian.",
   "start": 49.797,
   "end": 52.037
  },
  {
   "scene": 15,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "Moth included.",
   "start": 52.287,
   "end": 53.333
  },
  {
   "scene": 16,
   "speaker": "leo",
   "text": "So every time I debug something…",
   "start": 53.683,
   "end": 55.901
  },
  {
   "scene": 17,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "…you're talking about my family.",
   "start": 55.981,
   "end": 57.56
  },
  {
   "scene": 17,
   "speaker": "mott",
   "text": "Stay curious. Not too close to the light.",
   "start": 58.11,
   "end": 60.478
  }
 ],
